[
    {
        "content": "<p>Is this expected? (I cannot find it mentioned in the documentation of <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Lean.registerBuiltinAttribute#doc\">docs#Lean.registerBuiltinAttribute</a>.) This is biting mathlib in the definition of <code>@[stacks]</code> and <code>@[kerodon]</code> attributes.</p>\n<p>I only know of a \"mwe\" using two modules, i.e. not play-ground ready. Here's a mwe using the <code>stacks</code> attribute in mathlib.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">StacksAttribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- defines the @stacks attribute</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- no declaration has been tagged so far</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: No tags found. -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">stacks_tags</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">stacks</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">A04Q</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bar</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- **issue**: now, the same is true --- but I expected `Bar` to be tagged</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: No tags found. -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">stacks_tags</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The <code>@stacks</code> attribute is defined similarly to the <code>myattr</code> attribute in the following example:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">module</span>\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Command</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">section</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- information carried by the attribute</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"sd\">/-- The name of the declaration with the given tag. -/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">declName</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Name</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"sd\">/-- The database tag. -/</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">BEq</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Hashable</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- Defines the `tagExt` extension for storing all `Tag`s in the environment.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">`addImportedFn` is a constant function to avoid a performance overhead during initialization. -/</span>\n<span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tagExt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SimplePersistentEnvExtension</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Array</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Array</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tag</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">registerSimplePersistentEnvExtension</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">addImportedFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tags</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tags</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">addEntryFn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tags</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tags</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">addTagEntry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">MonadEnv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">declName</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Name</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">modifyEnv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">tagExt</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">addEntry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declName</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">declName</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">})</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myattr</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"myattr\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ppSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">attr</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">registerBuiltinAttribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`myattr</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">descr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Apply a my custom attribute to a declaration\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">attrKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tag</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">match</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">attr</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myattr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">tag</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tag</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">throwUnsupportedSyntax</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">addTagEntry</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tag</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">getString</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"c1\">-- docstrings are immutable once an asynchronous elaboration task has been started</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">applicationTime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">beforeElaboration</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 585919812,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1776349985
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think <code>beforeElaboration</code> attributes are not applied by the <code>inductive</code> or <code>structure</code> commands. It might just be <code>afterTypeChecking</code> and <code>afterCompilation</code>.</p>\n<p>This might be an oversight. It seems worth reporting as an issue, if you minimize it some more. For example, rather than have anything about environment extensions, you could have <code>add</code> simply output a log message.</p>",
        "id": 585924588,
        "sender_full_name": "Kyle Miller",
        "timestamp": 1776351051
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I just confirmed: both <code>afterCompilation</code> and <code>afterTypeChecking</code> do add the attribute.</p>",
        "id": 585925226,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1776351196
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"321459\">@Damiano Testa</span>, do you have a PR that fixes the stacks tag with this in mind?</p>",
        "id": 585944271,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1776355519
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I am just opening one.</p>",
        "id": 585944325,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1776355534
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>There is an issue here: the tag appends information about itself to the docstring of the declaration and this cannot happen unless the tag works <code>beforeElaboration</code>.</p>",
        "id": 585944730,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1776355644
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Does the docstring modification currently work on <code>structure</code> as it is now?</p>",
        "id": 585945024,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1776355727
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think that I checked and yes.</p>",
        "id": 585945061,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1776355739
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yes, I double checked:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">StacksAttribute</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">XX</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: none -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"n\">run_cmd</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{← Lean.findDocString? (← Lean.getEnv) `XX}\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">attribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">stacks</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ABCD</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">XX</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: some ([Stacks Tag ABCD](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/ABCD)) -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"n\">run_cmd</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{← Lean.findDocString? (← Lean.getEnv) `XX}\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 585945455,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1776355856
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I suspect that this would not work if you were applying the tag in a file that is not the one where the structure is defined, though.</p>",
        "id": 585945657,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1776355904
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Ok, I also checked this: if you add the attribute in a module that <em>imports</em> the declaration, then the attribute fails, saying <code>invalid doc string, declaration </code>XX<code> is in an imported module</code>.</p>",
        "id": 585947167,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1776356311
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Here's a minimal example for the bug above, spread across two files:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Command</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">syntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myattr</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"myattr\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">attr</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">initialize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">registerBuiltinAttribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">name</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`myattr</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">descr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"Apply a my custom attribute to a declaration\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">attrKind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"declaration `{decl}` tagged 'myattr'\"</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">applicationTime</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">beforeElaboration</span>\n<span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">cat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">lean</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: declaration `Foo` tagged 'myattr' -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">myattr</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- TODO: this does not print any output</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">myattr</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Bar</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 585947892,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1776356479
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think that you can reduce the imports to <code>import Lean.Attributes</code>.</p>",
        "id": 585949122,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1776356811
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Filed <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/pull/13433\">lean#13433</a></p>",
        "id": 585950587,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1776357202
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>This is getting somewhat pointless, but you can golf it a bit:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"declaration `{decl}` tagged 'myattr'\"</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 585950825,
        "sender_full_name": "Damiano Testa",
        "timestamp": 1776357266
    }
]